Significant changes from the original: migration to JDA 6 and the DAVE voice protocol, JDA-Chewtils in place of
jda-utilities, SQLite persistence, slash commands and button panels, Spotify metadata and radio resolution,
SSRF protection, rate limiting, and container/CI tooling. See PROJECT_STATUS.md.

This product depends on, among others: JDA, jdave, JDA-Chewtils, Lavaplayer, youtube-source, sqlite-jdbc, Logback,
jsoup and Typesafe Config. See each project for its own license terms.
